      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Estádio Olímpico Nilton Santos, Botafogo’s home ground, was built for the 2007 Pan American Games and later hosted the 2016 Olympics.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
